subsubsection.p:
    All drafts of work done in settings without prescribed time constraints, such as exercises, proofs, expository writing, and so forth,



must be written using the software capable of high-quality mathematical typesetting or neatly hand-written and scanned; 


must be spell-checked and proofread for grammatical correctness;


must be submitted electronically, via BlackBoard or shared link; and


must be available in a form suitable for commenting and editing.

